    allows UTF-8 characters to be constructed byte by byte, and also allows
    invalid UTF-8 sequences to be made. Just copy the byte in UTF-8 mode.
    Otherwise, pass it down as data. */

    c = 0;
    while (i++ < 2 && isxdigit(*p))
